  "solution": "BODMAS Rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/97072bdd1f5e802223d1f8f5b1a4b12c68165fa67f70d7e53e21992716e4924c.png] \n\nGiven: 27 + 3 ÷ 81 × 93 – 57\n\nFirst check all the options by one by one as:\n\n1) + and ÷\n\n= 27 ÷ 3 + 81 × 93 – 57\n\n= 9 + 81 × 93 – 57\n\n= 9 + 7533 – 57\n\n= 7485\n\n2) - and +\n\n= 27 - 3 ÷ 81 × 93 + 57\n\n= 27 - 0.037 × 93 + 57\n\n= 27 - 3.441 + 57\n\n= 80.559 ≈ 81\n\n3) × and +\n\n= 27 × 3 ÷ 81 + 93 – 57\n\n= 27 × (1)/( 27) + 93 - 57\n\n= 1 + 93 – 57\n\n= 94 – 57\n\n= 37\n\n4) ÷ and –\n\n= 27 + 3 - 81 × 93 ÷ 57\n\n= 27 + 3 - 81 × 1.631\n\n= 27 + 3 - 132.11\n\n= -102.11 ≈ -102\n\nHence, the signs '__**× and +**__' are interchanged to get the answer 37.",
